      "text": "Let's verify the steps.\n\nFrom \\(3^a = 81^{b+2} = 3^{4(b+2)}\\), we get  \n\\(a = 4b + 8\\).\n\nFrom \\(125^b = 5^{a-3}\\), since \\(125 = 5^3\\),  \n\\(5^{3b} = 5^{a-3}\\), so  \n\\(3b = a - 3\\), or \\(a = 3b + 3\\).\n\nSet equal:  \n\\(4b + 8 = 3b + 3\\)  \n\\(b = -5\\).\n\nThen \\(a = 3(-5) + 3 = -12\\).\n\nThus \\(ab = (-12)(-5) = 60\\).\n\nThe answer is 60.",
